## ✅ Keep These (Important)
# .gitignore itself
# .gitattributes
# LICENSE
# README.md
# package.json
# pnpm-lock.yaml (if using pnpm)

## 🔍 Exception Rules (use ! to un-ignore)
# Example: !node_modules/important-lib/
# !dist/production-build/
# !.env.example
